{
  "id": "416",
  "title": "Feeding Fish",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-10-29",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming looks after his friend's fish while he's away.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/559/412679f625027a2740ca8eec4273e07f6ac694e6.mp3?1508683710",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "喂鱼\n\n    小强家有几条很漂亮的鱼。这天，小强要回老家，就让小明帮忙喂鱼。\n    几天后，小明打电话给小强：“小强，你的鱼真漂亮啊！在哪儿买的啊？”\n    小强说：“好了，小明！别问这些没用的了。说吧，鱼死了几条？”\n    小明笑着说：“呵呵，小强，你太聪明了！鱼全死了！”",
    "traditional": "餵魚\n\n    小強家有幾條很漂亮的魚。這天，小強要回老家，就讓小明幫忙餵魚。\n    幾天後，小明打電話給小強：“小強，你的魚真漂亮啊！在哪兒買的啊？”\n    小強說：“好了，小明！別問這些沒用的了。說吧，魚死了幾條？”\n    小明笑著說：“呵呵，小強，你太聰明了！魚全死了！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Feeding Fish"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小强家有几条很漂亮的鱼。",
      "traditional": "小強家有幾條很漂亮的魚。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo qiáng jiā yǒu jǐ tiáo hěn piào liang de yú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "这天，小强要回老家，就让小明帮忙喂鱼。",
      "traditional": "這天，小強要回老家，就讓小明幫忙餵魚。",
      "pinyin": "zhè tiān xiǎo qiáng yào huí lǎo jiā jiù ràng xiǎo míng bāng máng wèi yú",
      "english": "Little Qiang has many beautiful fish at home."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "That day, Little Qiang had to return to his old home, so he asked Little Ming to feed the fish."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "几天后，小明打电话给小强：“小强，你的鱼真漂亮啊！在哪儿买的啊？”",
      "traditional": "幾天後，小明打電話給小強：“小強，你的魚真漂亮啊！在哪兒買的啊？”",
      "pinyin": "jǐ tiān hòu xiǎo míng dǎ diàn huà gěi xiǎo qiáng xiǎo qiáng nǐ de yú zhēn piào liang a zài nǎ'r mǎi de a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A few days later Little Ming called Little Qiang: “Little Qiang, your fish are really pretty! Where did you buy them?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小强说：“好了，小明！别问这些没用的了。说吧，鱼死了几条？”",
      "traditional": "小強說：“好了，小明！別問這些沒用的了。說吧，魚死了幾條？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo qiáng shuō hǎo le xiǎo míng bié wèn zhè xiē méi yòng de le shuō ba yú sǐ le jǐ tiáo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Qiang said: “Alright, Little Ming! Don't ask pointless questions. Tell me, how many fish died?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小明笑着说：“呵呵，小强，你太聪明了！鱼全死了！”",
      "traditional": "小明笑著說：“呵呵，小強，你太聰明了！魚全死了！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiào zhe shuō hē hē xiǎo qiáng nǐ tài cōng ming le yú quán sǐ le",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
